# Play test of Big Top Atoll (CIPlay big_top_atoll, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The circus ground on the ring's south side (x -32..32, z -48..-41, 2.5 m): the big top round -10 -44 (its entrance on the
# east, the notice at -0.5 -40.5, the stage and cash box on the west), the wagons round 14 -44, the menagerie wagon's
# chest at 32.8 -42, the pens and cages round -27 -43; the rig on the east ring (masts 44 -6 and 44 6, platforms at 17 m);
# Mirela's trunk on the lagoon floor at 28 0 (6 m down).
island Big Top Atoll
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Round-Up
wait 5
expect animals Llama 3
expect animals Goat 2
expect animals Dolphin 3
at 3 -44 h=3.5
walk 3 -44 to -4 -44 h=2.5
zone bigtop
expect step 1
read Ringmaster's notice
expect step 2
open Ringmaster's cash box
expect message key, the company says
open Menagerie wagon
expect step 3
catch Llama 3
expect step 4
catch Goat 2
expect step 5
at -27 -41 h=3.5
zone cages
expect message isn't a person's
kill Hyena
expect step 6
expect animals Hyena 0
at 44.9 -6 h=17.5
zone trapeze
expect step 7
read The escape artist's note
expect step 8
open Mirela's trick trunk
expect story whip 1
expect step 9
open Ringmaster's cash box
expect done
open Strongman's box
open Cook's barrel
open Rig box
open Sunk prop crate
